      "help": "Audio quieter than this counts as silence. Raise it (toward 0 dB) if background noise hides your pauses; lower it if quiet words get cut.",
      "label": "Threshold",
      "text": "−35",
      "unit": "dB"
    },
    {
      "ends": [
        "100",
        "2000"
      ],
      "help": "Only quiet stretches at least this long can be cut. Shorter pauses, like the ones between words, always stay.",
      "label": "Min silence",
      "text": "400",
      "unit": "ms"
    },
    {
      "ends": [
        "0",
        "500"
      ],
      "help": "Silence kept on each side of every cut, next to the sound, so words don't start or end abruptly. The timeline shows it in blue.",
